  "StockRole": "Superheavy Clan Omni",
  "YangsThoughts": "A continuation of the Timber Wolf OmniMech tradition, the Sea Wolf is the superheavy of the family of 'Mechs. At 175 ton there is plenty of room for advanced weaponry even after fitting a 430 XXL engine. The 'Mech was developed by Clan Sea Fox, but is exported to all Clans and their Allies, and although the Inner Sphere designation should be Mad Cat V, most factions use the Sea Wolf name even in the Inner Sphere.",
